  "releaseNotes": "Fixed an issue with Maximize for windows with the StandardWindow style. Before this fix, maximizing a window styled with StandardWindow would overlay the Taskbar, which is undesireable. There are severe issues with Microsoft's WindowChrome class, which the StandardWindow style utilizes.  Had to add a work-around to solve the problem by first removing the style before maximizing, the re-applying the style..",
